xml:lang="ru">Не уходи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non andare via</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ikanaide</span></p><p begin="16.310" end="17.410" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.310" end="16.520">こ</span><span begin="16.520" end="16.720">れ</span><span begin="16.720" end="16.940">以</span><span begin="16.940" end="17.410">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再也不要</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">再也不要</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Not any farther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">더 이상</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pas davantage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No sigas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nicht noch weiter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Прошу больше не надо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non continuare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kore ijou</span></p><p begin="18.010" end="19.540" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.010" end="18.250">散</span><span begin="18.250" end="18.470">っ</span><span begin="18.470" end="18.590">て</span><span begin="18.670" end="18.810">か</span><span begin="18.920" end="19.080">な</span><span begin="19.080" end="19.330">い</span><span begin="19.330" end="19.540">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样渐渐消散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就這樣漸漸消散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don&apos;t scatter and fade away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">흩어져 사라지지 마</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne te dissipe pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Desvaneciéndote</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verweh nicht noch mehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não vá se dissipando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не исчезай по крупицам</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">A svanire così</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Chitte kanaide</span></p><p begin="19.930" end="21.540" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.930" end="20.380">笑</span><span begin="20.380" end="20.500">わ</span><span begin="20.610" end="20.830">な</span><span begin="20.830" end="21.030">い</span><span begin="21.030" end="21.540">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别再笑了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">別再笑了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don&apos;t smile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">웃지 마</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne ris pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No te rías</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lach nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não sorria</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не улыбайся</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non sorridere</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Warawanaide</span></p><p begin="23.180" end="24.280" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.180" end="23.380">こ</span><span begin="23.380" end="23.590">れ</span><span begin="23.590" end="23.800">以</span><span begin="23.800" end="24.280">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要再这样</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不要再這樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Not anymore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">더 이상</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pas davantage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No sigas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nicht noch mehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Прошу больше не надо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non continuare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kore ijou</span></p><p begin="24.900" end="26.800" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.900" end="25.020">戸</span><span begin="25.120" end="25.540">惑</span><span begin="25.540" end="25.630">わ</span><span begin="25.720" end="26.070">せ</span><span begin="26.210" end="26.400">な</span><span begin="26.400" end="26.610">い</span><span begin="26.610" end="26.800">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我心乱如麻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓我心亂如麻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don&apos;t leave me so confused</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 혼란스럽게 하지 마</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne me trouble pas davantage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Desconcertándome aún más</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bring mich nicht weiter durcheinander</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não me deixe ainda mais confusa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не заставляй меня теряться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">A confondermi così</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tomadowasenaide</span></p><p begin="27.020" end="30.200" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.020" end="27.390">夢</span><span begin="27.490" end="27.800">の</span><span begin="27.900" end="28.190">中</span><span begin="28.320" end="28.460">も</span> <span begin="28.730" end="28.960">リ</span><span begin="28.960" end="29.180">ア</span><span begin="29.180" end="29.600">ル</span><span begin="29.600" end="29.820">な</span><span begin="29.820" end="30.030">の</span><span begin="30.030" end="30.200">妙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连梦中也如此真实 真是不可思议</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就連夢中也如此真實 真是不可思議</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even in my dreams it feels strangely real</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">꿈속마저 현실처럼 느껴지는 게 묘해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même dans mes rêves tout paraît réel c&apos;est étrange</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hasta en mis sueños todo parece real qué extraño</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst im Traum fühlt sich alles seltsam echt an</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até nos sonhos tudo parece real que estranho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже во сне всё кажется удивительно реальным</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche nei sogni sembra tutto reale che strano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yume no naka mo riaru na no myou</span></p><p begin="30.470" end="32.990" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.470" end="30.700">気</span><span begin="30.700" end="30.840">に</span><span begin="30.920" end="31.210">な</span><span begin="31.210" end="31.330">っ</span><span begin="31.330" end="31.550">て</span><span begin="31.550" end="31.740">仕</span><span begin="31.740" end="32.090">方</span><span begin="32.180" end="32.360">な</span><span begin="32.360" end="32.620">い</span><span begin="32.620" end="32.990">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我无论如何都无法释怀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓我無論如何都無法釋懷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I just can&apos;t get you out of my mind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">자꾸만 신경 쓰여 어쩔 수가 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne peux pas m&apos;empêcher d&apos;y penser</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No puedo dejar de pensar en ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du gehst mir einfach nicht aus dem Kopf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não consigo parar de pensar em você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не могу перестать думать о тебе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non riesco a smettere di pensarci</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ki ni natte shikata nai yo</span></p><p begin="34.480" end="35.720" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.480" end="34.730">何</span><span begin="34.730" end="34.840">も</span><span begin="34.840" end="34.950">か</span><span begin="34.950" end="35.140">も</span> <span begin="35.140" end="35.250">日</span><span begin="35.250" end="35.380">々</span><span begin="35.380" end="35.490">と</span><span begin="35.490" end="35.600">か</span><span begin="35.600" end="35.720">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论一切 甚至那些平凡的日常</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無論一切 甚至那些平凡的日常</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Everything even my everyday life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 무엇도 하루하루의 일상마저도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout absolument tout même mon quotidien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todo lo demás incluso mis días</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Alles selbst die Tage meines Lebens</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tudo até os dias que vivo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всё на свете даже мои будни</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni cosa persino i giorni che passano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nani mo kamo hibi toka mo</span></p><p begin="35.800" end="38.270" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.800" end="35.920">投</span><span begin="35.920" end="36.010">げ</span><span begin="36.010" end="36.140">捨</span><span begin="36.140" end="36.250">て</span><span begin="36.250" end="36.360">て</span> <span begin="36.440" end="36.860">君</span><span begin="36.860" end="36.980">を</span><span begin="37.060" end="37.330">知</span><span begin="37.330" end="37.450">り</span><span begin="37.530" end="37.800">た</span><span begin="37.800" end="38.270">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都想尽数抛开 只为更加了解你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">都想盡數拋開 只為更加了解你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I&apos;d throw it all away just to know you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모두 내던지고 너를 알고 싶어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je voudrais tout abandonner pour te connaître</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quiero dejarlo atrás para conocerte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Will ich fortwerfen nur um dich kennenzulernen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quero deixar para trás só para conhecer você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Хочу отбросить лишь бы узнать тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vorrei gettare via tutto per conoscerti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nagesutete kimi o shiritai</span></p><p begin="39.030" end="40.590" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.030" end="39.250">可</span><span begin="39.250" end="39.370">笑</span><span begin="39.480" end="39.710">し</span><span begin="39.710" end="39.920">い</span><span begin="39.920" end="40.590">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真是可笑呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">真是可笑呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Funny isn&apos;t it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우습지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C&apos;est absurde n&apos;est-ce pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Qué absurdo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schon seltsam nicht wahr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que coisa estranha não é</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забавно правда</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che assurdo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Okashii ne</span></p><p begin="41.400" end="47.650" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.400" end="41.650">名</span><span begin="42.050" end="42.940">前</span><span begin="43.310" end="43.560">を</span><span begin="43.910" end="44.230">そ</span><span begin="44.390" end="44.690">ば</span><span begin="44.810" end="46.220">で</span><span begin="46.700" end="46.820">呼</span><span begin="46.820" end="46.960">ん</span><span begin="46.960" end="47.160">で</span><span begin="47.160" end="47.280">み</span><span begin="47.280" end="47.510">な</span><span begin="47.510" end="47.620">い</span><span begin="47.620" end="47.650">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不试着在我身旁 轻声唤我的名字吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不試著在我身旁 輕聲喚我的名字嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Won&apos;t you try calling my name while you&apos;re beside me?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">곁에서 이름을 불러 보지 않을래?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et si tu essayais de prononcer mon nom à mes côtés ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Por qué no intentas decir mi nombre a mi lado?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Warum versuchst du nicht meinen Namen hier neben mir zu rufen?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que tal me chamar pelo nome bem de perto?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не хочешь попробовать произнести моё имя прямо рядом со мной?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché non provi a chiamarmi per nome qui accanto?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Namae o soba de yonde minai?</span></p><p begin="48.220" end="51.210" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.220" end="48.650">純</span><span begin="48.650" end="48.870">な</span><span begin="48.870" end="49.310">感</span><span begin="49.310" end="49.730">情</span><span begin="49.730" end="50.160">か</span><span begin="50.160" end="50.380">ら</span><span begin="50.380" end="50.660">ま</span><span begin="50.660" end="50.810">っ</span><span begin="50.810" end="51.210">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纯粹的情愫纠缠不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">純粹的情愫糾纏不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Pure feelings all tangled up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">순수한 감정이 뒤엉키고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mes sentiments les plus purs s&apos;emmêlent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los sentimientos más puros se enredan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unverfälschte Gefühle verheddern sich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sentimentos puros se entrelaçam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чистые чувства переплелись</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I sentimenti più puri si aggrovigliano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jun na kanjou karamatte</span></p><p begin="51.660" end="54.590" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.660" end="52.080">大</span><span begin="52.080" end="52.740">切</span><span begin="52.740" end="52.920">が</span><span begin="53.160" end="53.800">合</span><span begin="53.800" end="54.070">間</span><span begin="54.070" end="54.240">っ</span><span begin="54.240" end="54.590">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">珍视的心意也交织其中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">珍視的心意也交織其中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">With everything precious caught in between</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">소중한 마음까지 한데 얽혀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ce qui m&apos;est cher vient s&apos;y mêler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y lo más preciado se entremezcla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und alles was mir kostbar ist mischt sich darunter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E tudo o que é precioso se mistura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё дорогое сердцу вплелось в них</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E ciò che mi è caro si intreccia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Taisetsu ga aimatte</span></p><p begin="54.890" end="57.780" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.890" end="55.080">何</span><span begin="55.080" end="55.320">処</span><span begin="55.320" end="55.530">へ</span><span begin="55.530" end="55.730">向</span><span begin="55.730" end="56.010">か</span><span begin="56.010" end="56.170">え</span><span begin="56.170" end="56.600">ば</span><span begin="56.600" end="57.020">良い</span><span begin="57.020" end="57.450">の</span><span begin="57.450" end="57.780">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟该往何处前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">究竟該往何處前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I don&apos;t know which way I should go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어디로 향해야 하는지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne sais plus vers où me diriger</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sin saber hacia dónde debería ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wohin soll ich mich nur wenden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para onde devo seguir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Куда же мне теперь идти</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non so più verso dove andare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doko e mukaeba ii no ka</span></p><p begin="58.070" end="1:01.370" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.070" end="58.210">行</span><span begin="58.300" end="58.680">方</span><span begin="58.930" end="59.180">不</span><span begin="59.180" end="1:00.030">明</span><span begin="1:00.030" end="1:00.330">な</span><span begin="1:00.450" end="1:00.880">ま</span><span begin="1:00.880" end="1:01.370">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至今仍迷失了方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">至今仍迷失了方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Still lost without a trace</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여전히 갈 곳을 잃은 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Toujours perdue sans savoir où aller</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigo sin encontrar el rumbo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Noch immer ohne jede Richtung</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Continuo sem rumo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так и оставаясь потерянной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Resto senza una direzione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yukue fumei na mama</span></p><p begin="1:01.730" end="1:04.920" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.730" end="1:01.830">だ</span><span begin="1:01.930" end="1:02.400">か</span><span begin="1:02.400" end="1:02.620">ら</span><span begin="1:02.620" end="1:03.010">愛</span><span begin="1:03.010" end="1:03.450">想</span><span begin="1:03.450" end="1:03.860">振</span><span begin="1:03.860" end="1:04.000">り</span><span begin="1:04.110" end="1:04.360">ま</span><span begin="1:04.360" end="1:04.440">い</span><span begin="1:04.520" end="1:04.920">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是只能四处强颜欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">於是只能四處強顏歡笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So I keep putting on a friendly smile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서 애써 싹싹하게 굴고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors je distribue des sourires de façade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por eso reparto sonrisas de cortesía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Darum lächle ich allen gefällig zu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por isso distribuo sorrisos de fachada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поэтому я расточаю любезности</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così dispenso sorrisi di circostanza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dakara aisou furimaite</span></p><p begin="1:05.150" end="1:08.340" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.150" end="1:05.390">そ</span><span begin="1:05.390" end="1:05.590">れ</span><span begin="1:05.590" end="1:05.820">じゃ</span><span begin="1:05.820" end="1:06.030">気</span><span begin="1:06.030" end="1:06.440">持</span><span begin="1:06.440" end="1:06.660">ち</span><span begin="1:06.660" end="1:07.300">伝</span><span begin="1:07.300" end="1:07.430">わ</span><span begin="1:07.430" end="1:07.530">ん</span><span begin="1:07.530" end="1:07.790">な</span><span begin="1:07.790" end="1:07.940">い</span><span begin="1:07.940" end="1:08.340">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可这样终究无法传达心意呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可這樣終究無法傳達心意呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">But that won&apos;t get my feelings across will it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서는 마음이 전해지지 않겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais ainsi mes sentiments ne peuvent pas t&apos;atteindre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero así mis sentimientos no llegan hasta ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch so kommen meine Gefühle nicht bei dir an</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas assim meus sentimentos não chegam até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но так мои чувства до тебя не дойдут</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma così i miei sentimenti non arrivano a te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore ja kimochi tsutawannai ne</span></p><p begin="1:08.790" end="1:11.630" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.790" end="1:09.170">ああ</span> <span begin="1:09.250" end="1:09.440">ま</span><span begin="1:09.440" end="1:09.690">た</span><span begin="1:09.690" end="1:10.120">や</span><span begin="1:10.120" end="1:10.310">る</span><span begin="1:10.310" end="1:10.520">せ</span><span begin="1:10.520" end="1:10.770">な</span><span begin="1:10.770" end="1:11.170">い</span><span begin="1:11.170" end="1:11.630">や</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 又是这般无可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 又是這般無可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah here comes that helpless feeling again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 또다시 이 답답함만 남아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah encore cette amère impuissance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah otra vez esta amarga impotencia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ach wieder bleibt nur dieses Gefühl der Ohnmacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah mais uma vez essa angústia sem saída</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах снова эта безысходная тоска</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah di nuovo questa malinconia senza rimedio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa mata yarusenai ya</span></p><p begin="1:12.000" end="1:17.370" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.000" end="1:12.550">今日</span><span begin="1:12.660" end="1:13.090">も</span><span begin="1:13.090" end="1:13.430">変</span><span begin="1:13.530" end="1:13.930">わ</span><span begin="1:13.930" end="1:14.380">ら</span><span begin="1:14.380" end="1:14.600">な</span><span begin="1:14.600" end="1:14.810">い</span><span begin="1:14.810" end="1:15.150">ま</span><span begin="1:15.240" end="1:17.370">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天也依旧一成不变</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">今天也依舊一成不變</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And today nothing has changed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오늘도 변함없는 채로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Aujourd&apos;hui encore rien n&apos;a changé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hoy todo sigue igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch heute bleibt alles unverändert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Hoje também tudo continua igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И сегодня всё без перемен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche oggi tutto rimane com&apos;è</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kyou mo kawaranai mama</span></p><p begin="1:21.910" end="1:23.290" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.910" end="1:22.230">ねえ</span><span begin="1:22.230" end="1:22.260">、</span><span begin="1:22.360" end="1:22.520">な</span><span begin="1:22.520" end="1:22.760">ん</span><span begin="1:22.760" end="1:23.290">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 为什么呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">吶 為什麼呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Hey why</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">있잖아 어째서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dis-moi pourquoi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oye ¿por qué</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hey warum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ei por que</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Скажи почему</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ehi perché</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nee, nande</span></p><p begin="1:24.870" end="1:28.130" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.870" end="1:25.060">揺</span><span begin="1:25.060" end="1:25.340">さ</span><span begin="1:25.340" end="1:25.530">ぶ</span><span begin="1:25.530" end="1:25.770">ら</span><span begin="1:25.770" end="1:26.110">れ</span><span begin="1:26.600" end="1:26.760">て</span><span begin="1:26.840" end="1:27.040">い</span><span begin="1:27.040" end="1:27.240">る</span><span begin="1:27.240" end="1:28.130">心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这颗心总是被你牵动</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這顆心總是被你牽動</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Is my heart being shaken like this</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마음이 이렇게 흔들리는 걸까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mon cœur est si bouleversé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mi corazón está tan agitado?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ist mein Herz nur so aufgewühlt?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Meu coração está tão abalado?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Моё сердце так мечется</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il mio cuore è così scosso?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yusaburarete iru kokoro</span></p><p begin="1:28.520" end="1:30.080" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.520" end="1:28.960">開</span><span begin="1:28.960" end="1:29.070">か</span><span begin="1:29.160" end="1:29.360">な</span><span begin="1:29.360" end="1:29.610">い</span><span begin="1:29.610" end="1:30.080">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请先别将它打开</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">請先別將它打開</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Don&apos;t open it yet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">열지 말아 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne l&apos;ouvre pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No lo abras todavía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Öffne es noch nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não o abra ainda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не раскрывай его</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non aprirlo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hirakanaide</span></p><p begin="1:31.720" end="1:32.850" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.720" end="1:31.810">こ</span><span begin="1:31.810" end="1:31.950">っ</span><span begin="1:31.950" end="1:32.160">ち</span><span begin="1:32.160" end="1:32.390">は</span><span begin="1:32.390" end="1:32.520">ま</span><span begin="1:32.600" end="1:32.850">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我这边</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為我這邊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I&apos;m still not ready</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">난 아직</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">De mon côté il me faut encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque yo aún</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich für meinen Teil brauche noch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque eu ainda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ведь мне пока</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché io invece ho ancora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kocchi wa mada</span></p><p begin="1:33.450" end="1:35.360" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.450" end="1:33.570">時</span><span begin="1:33.660" end="1:33.880">間</span><span begin="1:33.880" end="1:34.100">が</span><span begin="1:34.100" end="1:34.230">か</span><span begin="1:34.330" end="1:34.610">か</span><span begin="1:34.610" end="1:34.700">る</span><span begin="1:34.780" end="1:35.020">の</span><span begin="1:35.180" end="1:35.360">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还需要多一点时间</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">還需要多一點時間</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I need a little more time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">시간이 좀 더 필요하니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un peu de temps</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Necesito algo más de tiempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Etwas mehr Zeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Preciso de mais tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Нужно ещё немного времени</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Bisogno di tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jikan ga kakaru no de</span></p><p begin="1:35.590" end="1:41.690" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.590" end="1:35.950">君</span><span begin="1:36.040" end="1:36.920">の</span><span begin="1:37.320" end="1:37.740">声</span><span begin="1:37.740" end="1:38.030">ば</span><span begin="1:38.030" end="1:38.160">っ</span><span begin="1:38.160" end="1:38.530">か</span> <span begin="1:39.020" end="1:39.470">響</span><span begin="1:39.470" end="1:39.800">い</span><span begin="1:39.900" end="1:40.120">て</span><span begin="1:40.120" end="1:40.320">る</span><span begin="1:40.320" end="1:40.770">月</span><span begin="1:40.770" end="1:41.180">曜</span><span begin="1:41.180" end="1:41.690">日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星期一的时光里 回荡的尽是你的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">星期一的時光裡 迴盪的盡是你的聲音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Your voice is all that echoes through my Monday</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네 목소리만 울려 퍼지는 월요일</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un lundi où seule ta voix ne cesse de résonner</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un lunes en el que solo resuena tu voz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein Montag an dem nur deine Stimme widerhallt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma segunda-feira em que só a sua voz continua ecoando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В этот понедельник звучит лишь твой голос</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È lunedì e risuona soltanto la tua voce</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi no koe bakka hibiiteru getsuyoubi</span></p><p begin="1:43.070" end="1:44.950" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.070" end="1:43.300">華</span><span begin="1:43.300" end="1:43.420">や</span><span begin="1:43.420" end="1:43.530">い</span><span begin="1:43.530" end="1:43.730">だ</span> <span begin="1:43.730" end="1:43.840">時</span><span begin="1:43.840" end="1:44.050">間</span><span begin="1:44.050" end="1:44.180">さ</span><span begin="1:44.180" end="1:44.350">え</span> <span begin="1:44.350" end="1:44.510">そ</span><span begin="1:44.510" end="1:44.570">っ</span><span begin="1:44.570" end="1:44.690">ち</span><span begin="1:44.690" end="1:44.820">の</span><span begin="1:44.820" end="1:44.950">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连那些欢欣的时刻 也被我抛在一旁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就連那些歡欣的時刻 也被我拋在一旁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even the brightest moments pushed aside</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">들뜬 시간마저 제쳐 두고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même les instants les plus joyeux je les laisse de côté</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso los momentos más radiantes quedan de lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst die schönsten Stunden lasse ich links liegen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Deixando de lado até os momentos mais radiantes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже радостные мгновения остаются в стороне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ignorando perfino i momenti più splendidi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hanayaida jikan sae socchi noke</span></p><p begin="1:45.020" end="1:46.920" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.020" end="1:45.470">僕</span><span begin="1:45.470" end="1:45.650">を</span><span begin="1:45.650" end="1:45.920">知</span><span begin="1:45.920" end="1:46.030">り</span><span begin="1:46.130" end="1:46.380">た</span><span begin="1:46.380" end="1:46.890">い</span><span begin="1:46.890" end="1:46.920">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你想了解我吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你想了解我嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Do you want to know me?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 알고 싶어?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu veux me connaître ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Quieres conocerme?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Willst du mich kennenlernen?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quer me conhecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Хочешь узнать меня?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vuoi conoscermi?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Boku o shiritai?</span></p><p begin="1:47.570" end="1:49.320" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.570" end="1:47.740">可</span><span begin="1:47.820" end="1:47.940">笑</span><span begin="1:48.040" end="1:48.270">し</span><span begin="1:48.270" end="1:48.480">い</span><span begin="1:48.480" end="1:49.320">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真是可笑呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">真是可笑呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Funny isn&apos;t it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우습지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C&apos;est absurde n&apos;est-ce pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Qué absurdo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schon seltsam nicht wahr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que coisa estranha não é</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забавно правда</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che assurdo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Okashii ne</span></p><p begin="1:49.960" end="1:56.200" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.960" end="1:50.910">来</span><span begin="1:51.200" end="1:51.530">世</span><span begin="1:51.890" end="1:52.200">あ</span><span begin="1:52.520" end="1:52.940">た</span><span begin="1:52.940" end="1:53.280">り</span><span begin="1:53.390" end="1:54.820">で</span><span begin="1:55.280" end="1:55.750">遊</span><span begin="1:55.750" end="1:55.990">ぼ</span><span begin="1:55.990" end="1:56.200">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不如等到来世 再一起玩闹吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不如等到來世 再一起玩鬧吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s hang out sometime in the next life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다음 생쯤에 함께 놀자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">On s&apos;amusera ensemble dans une autre vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Juguemos en alguna vida futura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass uns irgendwann im nächsten Leben etwas unternehmen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos nos divertir em alguma outra vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Давай погуляем как-нибудь в следующей жизни</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Giochiamo insieme magari nella prossima vita</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Raise atari de asobou</span></p><p begin="1:56.780" end="1:59.800" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.780" end="1:57.230">純</span><span begin="1:57.230" end="1:57.430">な</span><span begin="1:57.430" end="1:57.870">感</span><span begin="1:57.870" end="1:58.300">情</span><span begin="1:58.300" end="1:58.760">か</span><span begin="1:58.760" end="1:58.960">ら</span><span begin="1:58.960" end="1:59.250">ま</span><span begin="1:59.250" end="1:59.380">っ</span><span begin="1:59.380" end="1:59.800">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纯粹的情愫纠缠不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">純粹的情愫糾纏不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Pure feelings all tangled up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">순수한 감정이 뒤엉키고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mes sentiments les plus purs s&apos;emmêlent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los sentimientos más puros se enredan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unverfälschte Gefühle verheddern sich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sentimentos puros se entrelaçam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чистые чувства переплелись</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I sentimenti più puri si aggrovigliano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jun na kanjou karamatte</span></p><p begin="2:00.230" end="2:03.180" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.230" end="2:00.650">大</span><span begin="2:00.650" end="2:01.320">切</span><span begin="2:01.320" end="2:01.490">が</span><span begin="2:01.730" end="2:02.360">合</span><span begin="2:02.360" end="2:02.640">間</span><span begin="2:02.640" end="2:02.800">っ</span><span begin="2:02.800" end="2:03.180">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">珍视的心意也交织其中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">珍視的心意也交織其中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">With everything precious caught in between</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">소중한 마음까지 한데 얽혀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ce qui m&apos;est cher vient s&apos;y mêler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y lo más preciado se entremezcla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und alles was mir kostbar ist mischt sich darunter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E tudo o que é precioso se mistura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё дорогое сердцу вплелось в них</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E ciò che mi è caro si intreccia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Taisetsu ga aimatte</span></p><p begin="2:03.450" end="2:06.300" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.450" end="2:03.650">何</span><span begin="2:03.650" end="2:03.880">処</span><span begin="2:03.880" end="2:04.110">へ</span><span begin="2:04.110" end="2:04.300">向</span><span begin="2:04.300" end="2:04.580">か</span><span begin="2:04.580" end="2:04.740">え</span><span begin="2:04.740" end="2:05.160">ば</span><span begin="2:05.160" end="2:05.610">良い</span><span begin="2:05.610" end="2:06.020">の</span><span begin="2:06.020" end="2:06.300">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟该往何处前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">究竟該往何處前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I don&apos;t know which way I should go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어디로 향해야 하는지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne sais plus vers où me diriger</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sin saber hacia dónde debería ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wohin soll ich mich nur wenden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para onde devo seguir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Куда же мне теперь идти</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non so più verso dove andare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doko e mukaeba ii no ka</span></p><p begin="2:06.660" end="2:09.960" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.660" end="2:06.780">行</span><span begin="2:06.870" end="2:07.250">方</span><span begin="2:07.500" end="2:07.750">不</span><span begin="2:07.750" end="2:08.600">明</span><span begin="2:08.600" end="2:08.890">な</span><span begin="2:09.010" end="2:09.450">ま</span><span begin="2:09.450" end="2:09.960">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至今仍迷失了方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">至今仍迷失了方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Still lost without a trace</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여전히 갈 곳을 잃은 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Toujours perdue sans savoir où aller</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigo sin encontrar el rumbo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Noch immer ohne jede Richtung</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Continuo sem rumo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так и оставаясь потерянной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Resto senza una direzione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yukue fumei na mama</span></p><p begin="2:10.330" end="2:13.430" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.330" end="2:10.410">だ</span><span begin="2:10.510" end="2:10.970">か</span><span begin="2:10.970" end="2:11.160">ら</span><span begin="2:11.160" end="2:11.590">愛</span><span begin="2:11.590" end="2:12.020">想</span><span begin="2:12.020" end="2:12.450">振</span><span begin="2:12.450" end="2:12.560">り</span><span begin="2:12.670" end="2:12.940">ま</span><span begin="2:12.940" end="2:13.010">い</span><span begin="2:13.090" end="2:13.430">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是只能四处强颜欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">於是只能四處強顏歡笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So I keep putting on a friendly smile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서 애써 싹싹하게 굴고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors je distribue des sourires de façade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por eso reparto sonrisas de cortesía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Darum lächle ich allen gefällig zu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por isso distribuo sorrisos de fachada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поэтому я расточаю любезности</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così dispenso sorrisi di circostanza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dakara aisou furimaite</span></p><p begin="2:13.720" end="2:16.900" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.720" end="2:13.960">そ</span><span begin="2:13.960" end="2:14.160">れ</span><span begin="2:14.160" end="2:14.390">じゃ</span><span begin="2:14.390" end="2:14.600">気</span><span begin="2:14.600" end="2:15.020">持</span><span begin="2:15.020" end="2:15.230">ち</span><span begin="2:15.230" end="2:15.870">伝</span><span begin="2:15.870" end="2:15.990">わ</span><span begin="2:15.990" end="2:16.100">ん</span><span begin="2:16.100" end="2:16.340">な</span><span begin="2:16.340" end="2:16.520">い</span><span begin="2:16.520" end="2:16.900">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可这样终究无法传达心意呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可這樣終究無法傳達心意呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">But that won&apos;t get my feelings across will it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서는 마음이 전해지지 않겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais ainsi mes sentiments ne peuvent pas t&apos;atteindre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero así mis sentimientos no llegan hasta ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch so kommen meine Gefühle nicht bei dir an</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas assim meus sentimentos não chegam até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но так мои чувства до тебя не дойдут</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma così i miei sentimenti non arrivano a te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore ja kimochi tsutawannai ne</span></p><p begin="2:17.370" end="2:20.200" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.370" end="2:17.760">ああ</span> <span begin="2:17.840" end="2:18.020">ま</span><span begin="2:18.020" end="2:18.280">た</span><span begin="2:18.280" end="2:18.670">や</span><span begin="2:18.670" end="2:18.880">る</span><span begin="2:18.880" end="2:19.110">せ</span><span begin="2:19.110" end="2:19.350">な</span><span begin="2:19.350" end="2:19.770">い</span><span begin="2:19.770" end="2:20.200">や</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 又是这般无可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 又是這般無可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah here comes that helpless feeling again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 또다시 이 답답함만 남아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah encore cette amère impuissance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah otra vez esta amarga impotencia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ach wieder bleibt nur dieses Gefühl der Ohnmacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah mais uma vez essa angústia sem saída</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах снова эта безысходная тоска</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah di nuovo questa malinconia senza rimedio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa mata yarusenai ya</span></p><p begin="2:20.580" end="2:27.770" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.580" end="2:21.120">今日</span><span begin="2:21.230" end="2:21.660">も</span><span begin="2:21.660" end="2:22.010">変</span><span begin="2:22.090" end="2:22.540">わ</span><span begin="2:22.540" end="2:22.950">ら</span><span begin="2:22.950" end="2:23.200">な</span><span begin="2:23.200" end="2:23.400">い</span><span begin="2:23.400" end="2:23.770">ま</span><span begin="2:23.860" end="2:27.770">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天也依旧一成不变</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">今天也依舊一成不變</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And today nothing has changed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오늘도 변함없는 채로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Aujourd&apos;hui encore rien n&apos;a changé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hoy todo sigue igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch heute bleibt alles unverändert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Hoje também tudo continua igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И сегодня всё без перемен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche oggi tutto rimane com&apos;è</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kyou mo kawaranai mama</span></p><p begin="2:37.660" end="2:40.810" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.660" end="2:37.970">ど</span><span begin="2:37.970" end="2:38.350">う</span><span begin="2:38.350" end="2:38.520">し</span><span begin="2:38.520" end="2:38.810">た</span><span begin="2:38.810" end="2:39.270">ら</span><span begin="2:39.360" end="2:39.540">こ</span><span begin="2:39.690" end="2:40.190">の</span><span begin="2:40.190" end="2:40.810">殻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟要怎样才能将这层外壳</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">究竟要怎樣才能將這層外殼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">How can I get this shell</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어떻게 해야 이 껍질을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette carapace comment pourrais-je</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esta coraza ¿cómo podría</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie könnte ich diese Schale nur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esta casca como será que posso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Как же мне эту скорлупу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo guscio come potrei mai</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dou shitara kono kara</span></p><p begin="2:41.080" end="2:43.820" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.080" end="2:41.290">や</span><span begin="2:41.390" end="2:41.960">ぶ</span><span begin="2:41.960" end="2:42.240">れ</span><span begin="2:42.240" end="2:42.700">る</span><span begin="2:42.790" end="2:42.990">か</span><span begin="2:43.110" end="2:43.820">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彻底打破呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">徹底打破呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">To finally break?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">깨뜨릴 수 있을까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La briser un jour ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Llegar a romperla?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Endlich durchbrechen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quebrá-la?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Наконец разбить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Riuscire a spezzarlo?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yabureru kana</span></p><p begin="2:44.520" end="2:47.580" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.520" end="2:44.830">変</span><span begin="2:44.830" end="2:45.360">わ</span><span begin="2:45.360" end="2:45.560">れ</span><span begin="2:45.650" end="2:46.210">ず</span><span begin="2:46.210" end="2:46.410">に</span><span begin="2:46.520" end="2:47.400">時</span><span begin="2:47.400" end="2:47.580">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终无法改变的我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">始終無法改變的我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Still unable to change while time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">변하지 못한 채 시간은</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je n&apos;arrive pas à changer et pourtant le temps</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigo sin cambiar mientras el tiempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ohne dass ich mich ändern kann zieht die Zeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Continuo sem mudar e o tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я всё никак не меняюсь а время</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io non riesco a cambiare e il tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kawarezu ni toki wa</span></p><p begin="2:47.950" end="2:51.480" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.950" end="2:48.110">ま</span><span begin="2:48.230" end="2:48.770">た</span><span begin="2:48.770" end="2:49.100">過</span><span begin="2:49.100" end="2:49.550">ぎ</span><span begin="2:49.660" end="2:49.870">て</span><span begin="2:49.950" end="2:51.480">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能任由时光再度流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只能任由時光再度流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just keeps slipping by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">또 흘러가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Continue encore de s&apos;écouler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vuelve a escaparse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Schon wieder an mir vorbei</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Passa mais uma vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Снова проходит мимо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Continua a passare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mata sugiteku</span></p><p begin="2:53.360" end="2:56.380" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.360" end="2:53.790">純</span><span begin="2:53.790" end="2:54.010">な</span><span begin="2:54.010" end="2:54.450">感</span><span begin="2:54.450" end="2:54.870">情</span><span begin="2:54.870" end="2:55.300">か</span><span begin="2:55.300" end="2:55.520">ら</span><span begin="2:55.520" end="2:55.810">ま</span><span begin="2:55.810" end="2:55.950">っ</span><span begin="2:55.950" end="2:56.380">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纯粹的情愫纠缠不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">純粹的情愫糾纏不清</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Pure feelings all tangled up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">순수한 감정이 뒤엉키고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mes sentiments les plus purs s&apos;emmêlent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los sentimientos más puros se enredan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unverfälschte Gefühle verheddern sich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sentimentos puros se entrelaçam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чистые чувства переплелись</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I sentimenti più puri si aggrovigliano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jun na kanjou karamatte</span></p><p begin="2:56.810" end="2:59.730" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.810" end="2:57.210">大</span><span begin="2:57.210" end="2:57.870">切</span><span begin="2:57.870" end="2:58.070">が</span><span begin="2:58.320" end="2:58.950">合</span><span begin="2:58.950" end="2:59.200">間</span><span begin="2:59.200" end="2:59.370">っ</span><span begin="2:59.370" end="2:59.730">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">珍视的心意也交织其中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">珍視的心意也交織其中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">With everything precious caught in between</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">소중한 마음까지 한데 얽혀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ce qui m&apos;est cher vient s&apos;y mêler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y lo más preciado se entremezcla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und alles was mir kostbar ist mischt sich darunter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E tudo o que é precioso se mistura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё дорогое сердцу вплелось в них</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E ciò che mi è caro si intreccia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Taisetsu ga aimatte</span></p><p begin="3:00.040" end="3:02.950" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.040" end="3:00.220">何</span><span begin="3:00.220" end="3:00.420">処</span><span begin="3:00.420" end="3:00.660">へ</span><span begin="3:00.660" end="3:00.850">向</span><span begin="3:00.850" end="3:01.140">か</span><span begin="3:01.140" end="3:01.320">え</span><span begin="3:01.320" end="3:01.740">ば</span><span begin="3:01.740" end="3:02.170">良い</span><span begin="3:02.170" end="3:02.590">の</span><span begin="3:02.590" end="3:02.950">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟该往何处前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">究竟該往何處前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I don&apos;t know which way I should go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어디로 향해야 하는지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne sais plus vers où me diriger</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sin saber hacia dónde debería ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wohin soll ich mich nur wenden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para onde devo seguir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Куда же мне теперь идти</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non so più verso dove andare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doko e mukaeba ii no ka</span></p><p begin="3:03.220" end="3:06.540" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.220" end="3:03.340">行</span><span begin="3:03.430" end="3:03.810">方</span><span begin="3:04.060" end="3:04.310">不</span><span begin="3:04.310" end="3:05.160">明</span><span begin="3:05.160" end="3:05.460">な</span><span begin="3:05.580" end="3:06.010">ま</span><span begin="3:06.010" end="3:06.540">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至今仍迷失了方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">至今仍迷失了方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Still lost without a trace</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여전히 갈 곳을 잃은 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Toujours perdue sans savoir où aller</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigo sin encontrar el rumbo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Noch immer ohne jede Richtung</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Continuo sem rumo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так и оставаясь потерянной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Resto senza una direzione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yukue fumei na mama</span></p><p begin="3:06.890" end="3:10.080" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.890" end="3:06.990">だ</span><span begin="3:07.090" end="3:07.530">か</span><span begin="3:07.530" end="3:07.750">ら</span><span begin="3:07.750" end="3:08.130">愛</span><span begin="3:08.130" end="3:08.370">想</span><span begin="3:08.580" end="3:09.020">振</span><span begin="3:09.020" end="3:09.120">り</span><span begin="3:09.230" end="3:09.520">ま</span><span begin="3:09.520" end="3:09.590">い</span><span begin="3:09.670" end="3:10.080">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是只能四处强颜欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">於是只能四處強顏歡笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So I keep putting on a friendly smile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서 애써 싹싹하게 굴고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors je distribue des sourires de façade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por eso reparto sonrisas de cortesía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Darum lächle ich allen gefällig zu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por isso distribuo sorrisos de fachada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поэтому я расточаю любезности</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così dispenso sorrisi di circostanza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dakara aisou furimaite</span></p><p begin="3:10.300" end="3:13.500" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:10.300" end="3:10.530">そ</span><span begin="3:10.530" end="3:10.730">れ</span><span begin="3:10.730" end="3:10.940">じゃ</span><span begin="3:10.940" end="3:11.170">気</span><span begin="3:11.170" end="3:11.590">持</span><span begin="3:11.590" end="3:11.800">ち</span><span begin="3:11.800" end="3:12.440">伝</span><span begin="3:12.440" end="3:12.570">わ</span><span begin="3:12.570" end="3:12.660">ん</span><span begin="3:12.660" end="3:12.920">な</span><span begin="3:12.920" end="3:13.110">い</span><span begin="3:13.110" end="3:13.500">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可这样终究无法传达心意呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可這樣終究無法傳達心意呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">But that won&apos;t get my feelings across will it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서는 마음이 전해지지 않겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais ainsi mes sentiments ne peuvent pas t&apos;atteindre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero así mis sentimientos no llegan hasta ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch so kommen meine Gefühle nicht bei dir an</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas assim meus sentimentos não chegam até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но так мои чувства до тебя не дойдут</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma così i miei sentimenti non arrivano a te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore ja kimochi tsutawannai ne</span></p><p begin="3:13.950" end="3:16.780" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.950" end="3:14.300">ああ</span> <span begin="3:14.380" end="3:14.580">ま</span><span begin="3:14.580" end="3:14.790">た</span><span begin="3:14.790" end="3:15.240">や</span><span begin="3:15.240" end="3:15.440">る</span><span begin="3:15.440" end="3:15.660">せ</span><span begin="3:15.660" end="3:15.910">な</span><span begin="3:15.910" end="3:16.310">い</span><span begin="3:16.310" end="3:16.780">や</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 又是这般无可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 又是這般無可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah here comes that helpless feeling again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 또다시 이 답답함만 남아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah encore cette amère impuissance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah otra vez esta amarga impotencia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ach wieder bleibt nur dieses Gefühl der Ohnmacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah mais uma vez essa angústia sem saída</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах снова эта безысходная тоска</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah di nuovo questa malinconia senza rimedio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa mata yarusenai ya</span></p><p begin="3:17.150" end="3:23.410" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:17.150" end="3:17.680">今日</span><span begin="3:17.790" end="3:18.220">も</span><span begin="3:18.220" end="3:18.580">変</span><span begin="3:18.660" end="3:19.080">わ</span><span begin="3:19.080" end="3:19.510">ら</span><span begin="3:19.510" end="3:19.770">な</span><span begin="3:19.770" end="3:19.940">い</span><span begin="3:19.940" end="3:20.310">ま</span><span begin="3:20.400" end="3:23.410">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天也依旧一成不变</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">今天也依舊一成不變</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And today nothing has changed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오늘도 변함없는 채로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Aujourd&apos;hui encore rien n&apos;a changé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hoy todo sigue igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch heute bleibt alles unverändert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Hoje também tudo continua igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И сегодня всё без перемен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche oggi tutto rimane com&apos;è</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kyou mo kawaranai mama</span></p><p begin="3:23.800" end="3:24.720" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:23.800" end="3:24.300">あ</span><span begin="3:24.300" end="3:24.720">あ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ach</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ах</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa</span></p><p begin="3:25.710" end="3:28.750" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:25.710" end="3:25.830">わ</span><span begin="3:25.910" end="3:26.410">か</span><span begin="3:26.410" end="3:26.800">ら</span><span begin="3:26.800" end="3:27.110">な</span><span begin="3:27.110" end="3:27.270">い</span><span begin="3:27.270" end="3:27.590">ま</span><span begin="3:27.730" end="3:28.750">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依然找不到答案</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">依然找不到答案</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Still none the wiser</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여전히 알지 못한 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Toujours sans rien comprendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigo sin comprender nada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Noch immer ohne es zu verstehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ainda sem compreender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так ничего и не понимая</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Senza ancora capire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wakaranai mama</span></p><p begin="3:30.870" end="3:34.520" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:30.870" end="3:31.400">今日</span><span begin="3:31.510" end="3:31.930">も</span><span begin="3:31.930" end="3:32.280">変</span><span begin="3:32.360" end="3:32.780">わ</span><span begin="3:32.780" end="3:33.230">ら</span><span begin="3:33.230" end="3:33.490">な</span><span begin="3:33.490" end="3:33.660">い</span><span begin="3:33.660" end="3:34.000">ま</span><span begin="3:34.100" end="3:34.520">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天也依旧一成不变</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">今天也依舊一成不變</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And today nothing has changed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오늘도 변함없는 채로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Aujourd&apos;hui encore rien n&apos;a changé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hoy todo sigue igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch heute bleibt alles unverändert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Hoje também tudo continua igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И сегодня всё без перемен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche oggi tutto rimane com&apos;è</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kyou mo kawaranai mama</span></p></div></body></tt>